{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_372F00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，博士已经回收完毕。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Huey，感觉怎么样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"很舒服。……这里真厉害啊。Boss，我对你刮目相看了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"叫我Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嘴上这么说，可这里大家私下都叫你“Boss”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"话说回来，Snake，如果你想加强这里的技术开发，一定要把我分配到研发部门。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我一定能派上用场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"只要材料和设计图之类准备齐全，就能开始开发双足步行机甲了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"那当然帮大忙了，不过真的没关系吗？就算科学被用于战争？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我要用它来遏制自己过去犯下的错误。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"如果我的技术能帮助阻止Peace Walker计划的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"这也是Huey式的“威慑论”吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"还有，如果需要了解敌人的兵器或电子大脑，就<R=联系,CALL>我。我已经让人准备了专用线路。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=联系,CALL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"知道了。那就拜托你了，“博士”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯。无论如何，都要阻止<R=那家伙,COLDMAN>的计划！","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=那家伙,COLDMAN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}